urepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","review_id":"vXJdHXpZSvLAd2Gj6Y8gXQ","date":"2011-03-08T16:51:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9622098803520203,"text_excerpt":"This place is great! Sushi is fresh and the rolls are a great size and very inventive. I always get the Desiree roll (completely fried sushi roll goodness) and a Steve roll (completely not fried, fresh tuna, snowcrab and avocado with awesome spicy roe on the outside). Adding to this, the service is usually great as well, especially if Patrick is your server (a. k. a. the friendliest guy on the planet). It can get really busy there, especially at lunch time, so a few times I've been it kind of felt like our waiter forgot about us. But this is a no frills - get some good sushi kind of place- and I will keep coming back!"},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","review_id":"U2LApJOGeuHuw41ssdnNFA","date":"2011-03-04T20:22:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9430216550827026,"text_excerpt":"Up there with the best sushi in the N.O. area. The service is usually good, and if not, if you let them know, they will make every effort to make you comfortable. The food is DELICIOUS - consistently fresh fish. Great sashimi - Salmon, Tuna, Yellowtail, and \"white tuna\" being their best selections. Their Chirashi is one of the best values in town (especially at lunch) - be prepared to fill up on it. Good value lunch menu. Good special rolls, too. Love the noodle salad!"},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","review_id":"zxPINPcgNwbA_Xgx71drbw","date":"2016-07-23T23:21:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9427573680877686,"text_excerpt":"It is on my top 5 favorite sushi restaurants in town! I love the fact that they can make the rolls with brown rice. Salmon and tuna are always very fresh. The crunchy roll they make here is my favorite crunchy ever - it is creamy and it has tiny shrimps in the mix, and the tempura is always crunchy. Since we usually go for lunch, we always do the roll combination lunch special, I think it is a great deal for $9 - 2 rolls of your choice, salad, soup and small noodle salad. It can get crowded for lunch, specially on fridays, but the service is always good and fast. I am always out of there within 30-40min of arrival, which is a good thing at lunch time."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","photo_id":"hiIisBjpVG1OGJjEsy4FuA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hiIisBjpVG1OGJjEsy4FuA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595431447029114},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","photo_id":"BRZ4aFBuwm5pdz2vXwPaYQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/BRZ4aFBuwm5pdz2vXwPaYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7745302319526672},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","photo_id":"in9iiUr2VAeZKUBGogxmHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/in9iiUr2VAeZKUBGogxmHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7582276463508606},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","photo_id":"pgyAgxNCDi6m-UNBdPpZ8g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pgyAgxNCDi6m-UNBdPpZ8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.753738522529602},{"business_id":"bWJbqXuyEgGr7Q8Xf8HUwA","photo_id":"5sAQKBCrXEchjUkIKAuMiA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5sAQKBCrXEchjUkIKAuMiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7239270806312561}]},"notebook_case":null}
